#. ja: 一度でもここを通った冒険者の顔は<br>みんな覚えているわ。
#. de: Ich nehme alle Abenteurer, die hier vorbeikommen, ganz genau unter die Lupe.
#. fr: Je me souviens de chacun des aventuriers qui sont passés par ici.
#. column 21: But my duty extends beyond merely monitoring the movements of strangers. As a member of the Gods' Quiver, I am also charged with identifying those men and women possessed of potentially useful talent.
#. column 22: 0
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590015:0:20"
msgid "I recall the face of every adventurer who has passed my post."
msgstr "Я помню лицо каждого искателя приключений, который проходил мимо моего поста."

#. ja: 使いものになりそうな冒険者を探すのも、<br>私たち神勇隊の仕事なのよ。
#. de: Vielversprechende Leute merke ich mir, um sie bei Gelegenheit für Nophicas Schar anzuwerben.
#. fr: Après tout, dégotter des aventuriers compétents qui nous rendront des petits services fait partie du travail des flèches divines<nbsp>!
#. column 20: I recall the face of every adventurer who has passed my post.
#. column 22: 0
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590015:0:21"
msgid "But my duty extends beyond merely monitoring the movements of strangers. As a member of the Gods' Quiver, I am also charged with identifying those men and women possessed of potentially useful talent."
msgstr "Но мы, воины Богов, не только следим за чужаками. Ещё мы ищем среди них тех, чьи таланты могут пригодиться."

