#. ja: ここから西へ進めばタムタラの墓所、<br>東へ進めば鏡池桟橋だ。
#. de: Westlich von hier liegt die Gruft Tam-Tara, östlich der Spiegelsee.
#. fr: Vers l'ouest se trouve l'Hypogée de Tam-Tara, et à l'est, vous trouverez l'appontement du Miroir.
#. column 21: Both fall under the Wood Wailers' jurisdiction, so be sure to comport yourself respectfully should you pay either site a visit.
#. column 22: 0
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590129:0:20"
msgid "To the west of here you'll find the Tam<hyphen>Tara Deepcroft; to the east, the Mirror Planks."
msgstr "К западу отсюда — Глубокий склеп Там-Тара, к востоку — Пристань Зеркальных Досок."

#. ja: どちらにも鬼哭隊の衛士が警備にあたっている。<br>くれぐれも、森の中で妙な気は起こすなよ。
#. de: Beide Gebiete werden regelmäßig von Soldaten des Klageregiments patrouilliert, also stell dort keinen Unfug an!
#. fr: Les vigiles sombres pa<shy>trouil<shy>lent d'un côté comme de l'autre. Surtout, veillez à ne pas troubler le calme de la forêt.
#. column 20: To the west of here you'll find the Tam<hyphen>Tara Deepcroft; to the east, the Mirror Planks.
#. column 22: 0
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590129:0:21"
msgid "Both fall under the Wood Wailers' jurisdiction, so be sure to comport yourself respectfully should you pay either site a visit."
msgstr "И там, и там несут службу Стражи Леса. Ведите себя прилично, если решите туда заглянуть."

