#. ja: お前を見習って、俺も頑張らなきゃな。<br>この前みたいな無様は、もう御免だぜ。
#. de: Du musst noch viel lernen, aber auch ich werde mich anstrengen müssen. Solch eine Peinlichkeit wie neulich darf uns nicht mehr unterlaufen.
#. fr: Il me faut absolument prendre exemple sur vous et devenir plus fort... Je ne peux pas faire deux fois la même erreur.
#. column 21: 0
#. column 22: 0
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590550:0:20"
msgid "You've put us all to shame with your recent performance in the field. If I'm to keep up, I daresay I'll need bigger knives!"
msgstr "После твоих недавних подвигов нам за себя стыдно. Чтобы не отставать, пожалуй, придётся обзавестись ножами покрупнее!"

#. ja: 私たち「暁の血盟」は、元々2つの団体だったの。<br>その1つが、シャーレアン出身の私たち……「救世詩盟」。
#. de: Der harte Kern des Bundes der Morgenröte setzt sich aus Mitgliedern zusammen, die ursprünglich zu zwei verschiedenen Gruppen gehörten - zum einen zu den Exegeten aus Sharlayan.
#. fr: Les Héritiers de la Septième Aube tirent leur origine de deux or<shy>ga<shy>ni<shy>sa<shy>tions. La première, constituée de Sharlayanais, comme moi, était appelée le Cénacle du Savoir.
#. column 21: The second, made up of individuals that share your rare gift, was known as the Path of the Twelve.
#. column 22: The terrible events that ushered in the Seventh Umbral Era taught us that only together may we stand against the evil that seeks to consume us.
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590551:0:20"
msgid "Our organization, the Scions of the Seventh Dawn, was formed through the union of two separate entities. The first was comprised of Sharlayan natives such as myself, and was called the Circle of Knowing."
msgstr "Наша организация, Потомки Седьмой Зари, возникла в результате слияния двух отдельных групп. Первая состояла из выходцев из Шарлаяна, таких, как я, и называлась Кругом познающих."

#. ja: もう1つが、あなたのように不思議な力を持つ、<br>異能者たちの集団、「十二跡調査会」。
#. de: Zum anderen zum Pfad der Zwölf, dem hauptsächlich Abenteurer mit deiner Gabe angehörten.
#. fr: La seconde, regroupant des possesseurs du pouvoir de l'Écho, comme toi, portait le nom de Voie des Douze.
#. column 20: Our organization, the Scions of the Seventh Dawn, was formed through the union of two separate entities. The first was comprised of Sharlayan natives such as myself, and was called the Circle of Knowing.
#. column 22: The terrible events that ushered in the Seventh Umbral Era taught us that only together may we stand against the evil that seeks to consume us.
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590551:0:21"
msgid "The second, made up of individuals that share your rare gift, was known as the Path of the Twelve."
msgstr "Второе объединение, «Путь Двенадцати», состояло из людей с таким же редким даром, как у тебя."

#. ja: この2つの団体が5年前の第七霊災を機に手を組み、<br>結成した組織……それが、「暁の血盟」よ。
#. de: Bei der Katastrophe vor fünf Jahren haben sich diese beiden Gruppen zum Bund der Morgenröte zu<shy>sammen<shy>geschlossen.
#. fr: Suite aux événements tragiques survenus il y a cinq ans, lors du Fléau, ces deux or<shy>ga<shy>ni<shy>sa<shy>tions ont décidé de se regrouper pour poursuivre un objectif commun... et c'est ce qui nous lie aujourd'hui.
#. column 20: Our organization, the Scions of the Seventh Dawn, was formed through the union of two separate entities. The first was comprised of Sharlayan natives such as myself, and was called the Circle of Knowing.
#. column 21: The second, made up of individuals that share your rare gift, was known as the Path of the Twelve.
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590551:0:22"
msgid "The terrible events that ushered in the Seventh Umbral Era taught us that only together may we stand against the evil that seeks to consume us."
msgstr "Ужасные события, положившие начало Седьмой эре Умбрала, научили нас: лишь сообща мы сможем противостоять злу, что грозит поглотить мир."

#. ja: 私たち「暁の血盟」は、元々2つの団体だったの。<br>その1つが、シャーレアン出身の私たち……「救世詩盟」。
#. de: Der harte Kern des Bundes der Morgenröte setzt sich aus Mitgliedern zusammen, die ursprünglich zu zwei verschiedenen Gruppen gehörten - zum einen zu den Exegeten aus Sharlayan.
#. fr: Les Héritiers de la Septième Aube tirent leur origine de deux or<shy>ga<shy>ni<shy>sa<shy>tions. La première, constituée de Sharlayanais, comme moi, était appelée le Cénacle du Savoir.
#. column 21: The second, made up of individuals that share your rare gift, was known as the Path of the Twelve.
#. column 22: The terrible events that ushered in the Seventh Umbral Era taught us that only together may we stand against the evil that seeks to consume us.
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590552:0:20"
msgid "Our organization, the Scions of the Seventh Dawn, was formed through the union of two separate entities. The first was comprised of Sharlayan natives such as myself, and was called the Circle of Knowing."
msgstr "Наша организация, Потомки Седьмой Зари, возникла в результате слияния двух отдельных групп. Первая состояла из выходцев из Шарлаяна, таких, как я, и называлась Кругом познающих."

#. ja: もう1つが、あなたのように不思議な力を持つ、<br>異能者たちの集団、「十二跡調査会」。
#. de: Zum anderen zum Pfad der Zwölf, dem hauptsächlich Abenteurer mit deiner Gabe angehörten.
#. fr: La seconde, regroupant des possesseurs du pouvoir de l'Écho, comme toi, portait le nom de Voie des Douze.
#. column 20: Our organization, the Scions of the Seventh Dawn, was formed through the union of two separate entities. The first was comprised of Sharlayan natives such as myself, and was called the Circle of Knowing.
#. column 22: The terrible events that ushered in the Seventh Umbral Era taught us that only together may we stand against the evil that seeks to consume us.
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590552:0:21"
msgid "The second, made up of individuals that share your rare gift, was known as the Path of the Twelve."
msgstr "Второе объединение, «Путь Двенадцати», состояло из людей с таким же редким даром, как у тебя."

#. ja: この2つの団体が5年前の第七霊災を機に手を組み、<br>結成した組織……それが、「暁の血盟」よ。
#. de: Bei der Katastrophe vor fünf Jahren haben sich diese beiden Gruppen zum Bund der Morgenröte zu<shy>sammen<shy>geschlossen.
#. fr: Suite aux événements tragiques survenus il y a cinq ans, lors du Fléau, ces deux or<shy>ga<shy>ni<shy>sa<shy>tions ont décidé de se regrouper pour poursuivre un objectif commun... et c'est ce qui nous lie aujourd'hui.
#. column 20: Our organization, the Scions of the Seventh Dawn, was formed through the union of two separate entities. The first was comprised of Sharlayan natives such as myself, and was called the Circle of Knowing.
#. column 21: The second, made up of individuals that share your rare gift, was known as the Path of the Twelve.
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590552:0:22"
msgid "The terrible events that ushered in the Seventh Umbral Era taught us that only together may we stand against the evil that seeks to consume us."
msgstr "Ужасные события, положившие начало Седьмой эре Умбрала, научили нас: лишь сообща мы сможем противостоять злу, что грозит поглотить мир."

#. ja: 聞いたわ、あなたの活躍。<br>そもそも足手まといには声をかけないけれど……<br>正直、予想以上よ。
#. de: Ich habe mit großem Interesse gehört, was du getan hast. Wir nehmen nur fähige Leute in unseren Bund auf, aber du übertriffst alle Erwartungen.
#. fr: J'ai entendu que tu as réalisé de véritables exploits. J'avais remarqué ton potentiel, mais tu as déjà dépassé toutes mes attentes.
#. column 21: Be that as it may, it is fortunate that Thancred arrived when he did. Had he been but a moment later, I shudder to think what may have transpired.
#. column 22: 0
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590553:0:20"
msgid "I have heard word of your deeds. I am sparing in my praise, so know that you have truly impressed me."
msgstr "Я наслышана о твоих подвигах. Я нечасто хвалю, так что знай: ты меня и правда впечатлил<if $gn4>а</if>."

#. ja: それにしても、サンクレッドったら、<br>肝心のときにいないんだから。<br>あと一歩、登場が遅かったら……大惨事だったわね。
#. de: Ausgerechnet im entscheidenden Moment war Thancred nicht zur Stelle. Wärst du nicht eingeschritten, wäre die Geschichte katastrophal geendet.
#. fr: Quant à Thancred, comment a-t-il pu arriver en retard à un moment crucial comme celui-ci<nbsp>!? Quelques minutes de plus et c'était une tragédie...
#. column 20: I have heard word of your deeds. I am sparing in my praise, so know that you have truly impressed me.
#. column 22: 0
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590553:0:21"
msgid "Be that as it may, it is fortunate that Thancred arrived when he did. Had he been but a moment later, I shudder to think what may have transpired."
msgstr "Как бы то ни было, хорошо, что Танкрет прибыл вовремя. Опоздай он хоть на миг — и страшно представить, что бы случилось."

#. ja: 『七の月　散り　七の陽　昇りしとき<br>　天の理乱れ　地に臥せし骸蠢かん……』
#. de: <i>Wenn erst der rote Mond zersprungen,<br>die ganze Welt vom Chaos verschlungen<br>getaucht wird in ein neues Licht!<br>Wachgeküsst von warmer Wonne,<br>dem frühen Glanz der siebten Sonne,<br>der Tod aus dem finsteren Splitter bricht.</i>
#. fr: “Lorsque la septième lune déclinera et que le septième soleil se lèvera, l'ordre céleste sera alors bouleversé et les cadavres grouilleront à terre par milliers.”
#. column 21: Thus the Divine Chronicles seek to warn us once more. The meaning of these words now shines clear: they evoke the dire circumstance of this imperiled age.
#. column 22: The realm doth shudder and twist, and the dawn lieth cowering 'neath the stifling blanket of night. And we abide. We await the coming of the unborn era's seed─the Light which shall pierce the glowering Darkness.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590554:0:20"
msgid "<i>Seven waning moons see seven suns rise,<br>Divine order roils, fallen corpses writhe.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Седьмая луна угаснет — семь солнц взойдут,<br>Небесный порядок смутится, павшие восстанут.</i>"

#. ja: いにしえの預言書……「神歴記」に記された言葉です。<br>私たちはこれを、第七霊災の後……<br>今の時代に対する予言だと、解釈しています……。
#. de: Diese Worte stammen aus Mezayas Prophezeiung, die auf uralten Pergamenten geschrieben steht. Wir vermuten, dass sie sich auf die Zeit bezieht, in der wir jetzt leben, die Zeit nach der Siebten Katastrophe.
#. fr: C'est une prophétie ancienne que l'on peut lire dans l'Histoire des Dieux éorzéens. Il est fort probable qu'elle décrive les événements du septième fléau...
#. column 20: <i>Seven waning moons see seven suns rise,<br>Divine order roils, fallen corpses writhe.</i>
#. column 22: The realm doth shudder and twist, and the dawn lieth cowering 'neath the stifling blanket of night. And we abide. We await the coming of the unborn era's seed─the Light which shall pierce the glowering Darkness.
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590554:0:21"
msgid "Thus the Divine Chronicles seek to warn us once more. The meaning of these words now shines clear: they evoke the dire circumstance of this imperiled age. "
msgstr "Так «Божественные хроники» вновь предупреждают нас. Теперь их смысл ясен: в этих строках говорится о бедственном положении нашего мира."

#. ja: 予言の通り世界は変貌し……暁の輝きは、未だ闇の中……。<br>故に……私たちは、待ち望んでいるのです。<br>いずれ来たり闇を照らす、新しき時代の種を……。
#. de: Unsere vom Chaos verwüstete Welt wartet darauf, vom warmen Schein der Morgenröte wachgeküsst zu werden.
#. fr: Nous vivons aujourd'hui dans un monde ravagé par le chaos, mais il ne faut pas perdre espoir que les ténèbres laisseront un jour place à la lumière.
#. column 20: <i>Seven waning moons see seven suns rise,<br>Divine order roils, fallen corpses writhe.</i>
#. column 21: Thus the Divine Chronicles seek to warn us once more. The meaning of these words now shines clear: they evoke the dire circumstance of this imperiled age.
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590554:0:22"
msgid "The realm doth shudder and twist, and the dawn lieth cowering 'neath the stifling blanket of night. And we abide. We await the coming of the unborn era's seed─the Light which shall pierce the glowering Darkness."
msgstr "Мир содрогается и корчится, а рассвет прячется под тяжёлым покровом ночи. Мы же ждём. Ждём, когда прорастёт семя новой эпохи — свет, что пронзит сгущающуюся тьму."

#. ja: 『七の月　散り　七の陽　昇りしとき<br>　天の理乱れ　地に臥せし骸蠢かん……』
#. de: <i>Wenn erst der rote Mond zersprungen,<br>die ganze Welt vom Chaos verschlungen<br>getaucht wird in ein neues Licht!<br>Wachgeküsst von warmer Wonne,<br>dem frühen Glanz der siebten Sonne,<br>der Tod aus dem finsteren Splitter bricht.</i>
