#. macro: <if ($gn70 == 3)>Excuse me, <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if>.<else>Excuse me, <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if>.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 70 == 3 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590960:0:20"
msgid "<if ($gn70 == 1)>Excuse me, <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if>.<else><if ($gn70 == 2)>Wait a minute. I know you─the carriage into Gridania, right? It's me, Bremondt! How in the hells did you end up here, <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if>? Ah, never mind─you can tell me later. I've got to ask you somethin' first.<else><if ($gn70 == 3)>Excuse me, <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if>.<else>Excuse me, <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if>.</if></if></if> This might sound strange, but you haven't by chance seen a fella what looks exactly like me? I'm lookin' for my twin brothers, see, an' I heard they might've come through here."
msgstr "<if ($gn70 == 1)>Простите, <if $gn4>девушка<else>парень</if>.<else><if ($gn70 == 2)>Постойте-ка. Я вас знаю — мы ехали в повозке до Гридании, верно? Это же я, Бремондт! Как вы сюда попали, <if $gn4>девушка<else>парень</if>? Ладно, расскажешь потом. Сначала я кое-что спрошу.<else><if ($gn70 == 3)>Простите, <if $gn4>девушка<else>парень</if>.<else>Простите, <if $gn4>девушка<else>парень</if>.</if></if></if> Странный вопрос, но тебе случайно не попадался тип, точь-в-точь похожий на меня? Я ищу братьев-близнецов. Слышал, они могли здесь проходить."

#. ja: ラノシアにいたという噂をきけば、もうザナラーンに。<br>ザナラーンかと思えば、黒衣森に……<br>このままだと、俺たち兄弟は一生出会えねぇぞ。
#. de: Ich suche nämlich meine zwei Brüder. Erst habe ich sie in La Noscea gesucht, dann in Thanalan, schließlich im Finsterwald ... Ob ich sie jemals finde?
#. fr: (soupire) On m'a dit qu'ils étaient dans la Noscea, mais une fois arrivé sur place, ils étaient déjà partis pour le Thanalan. Le temps que j'y aille, et cette fois ils étaient partis vers Sombrelinceul. Si ce jeu de piste continue, je ne les reverrai jamais<nbsp>!
#. column 20: <if ($gn70 == 1)>Excuse me, <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if>.<else><if ($gn70 == 2)>Wait a minute. I know you─the carriage into Gridania, right? It's me, Bremondt! How in the hells did you end up here, <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if>? Ah, never mind─you can tell me later. I've got to ask you somethin' first.<else><if ($gn70 == 3)>Excuse me, <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if>.<else>Excuse me, <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if>.</if></if></if> This might sound strange, but you haven't by chance seen a fella what looks exactly like me? I'm lookin' for my twin brothers, see, an' I heard they might've come through here.
#. column 22: 0
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590960:0:21"
msgid "\\<sigh> They could be dead, for all I know. Least it feels like I've been chasin' ghosts for an eternity now."
msgstr "<i>Эх...</i> Может, они уже и умерли. Такое чувство, будто я целую вечность гоняюсь за призраками."

#. ja: ずいぶんと賑やかになったな。<br>英雄ってのが生まれると、<br>そこには多くの者が集ってくるもんさ。
#. de: Ganz schön was los hier, was? Ist ja klar, alle wollen <if $gn4>die neue Heldin<else>den neuen Held</if> von Eorzea sehen!
#. fr: On dirait que la chef a dégotté une bonne bande de héros en herbe. Oui, je reconnais que ça va faire du bien à Éorzéa d'avoir ces braves personnes pour la protéger.
#. column 21: 0
#. column 22: 0
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590961:0:20"
msgid "Looks like the Antecedent's found herself a good crop of aspirin' heroes. Aye, I reckon Eorzea'll be alright as long as these fine folk are around to protect her."
msgstr "Похоже, Предтеча собрала вокруг себя немало будущих героев. Ага, думаю, с такими славными людьми Эорзее ничего не грозит."

#. ja: 兄者、兄貴たちじゃねぇか！<br>くぅ、よくこれまで無事で！
#. de: Bruderherz, bist du es? D-Da seid ihr ja!
#. fr: Plusieurs personnes prétendaient m'avoir déjà vu avant alors que ça me disait rien<nbsp>! Du coup, je pensais bien que mes grands frères devaient être dans le coin<nbsp>!
#. column 21: 0
#. column 22: 0
#. macro: <switch $gn70><case>.<case>─like that time I met you, come to think of it.<case>.</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = global number 70 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590962:0:20"
msgid "Listen to these two, swappin' their stories. Life ain't always got to be an adventure, I say. Me, I'm the sort who enjoys a nice, relaxin' carriage ride, paired with a bottle of Bacchus<switch $gn70><case>.<case>─like that time I met you, come to think of it.<case>.</switch>"
msgstr "Послушай только, как эти двое байками обмениваются. Не обязательно же жизнь превращать в приключение. Я, например, люблю спокойно прокатиться в повозке, прихватив бутылочку «Вакха»<switch $gn70><case>.<case>— как тогда, когда мы с тобой познакомились, если подумать.<case>.</switch>"

#. ja: ここの再建費用を用立てに、砂蠍衆に会いに行ったら、<br>俺が今日3回も来たっていうじゃないか。<br>そこでピンときたぜ！
#. de: 0
#. fr: Quand je suis venu discuter frais de recon<shy>struc<shy>tion au Cartel des Scorpions, ils m'ont dit que ça faisait trois fois qu'ils me voyaient aujourd'hui. Là, j'ai compris<nbsp>!
#. column 20: Listen to these two, swappin' their stories. Life ain't always got to be an adventure, I say. Me, I'm the sort who enjoys a nice, relaxin' carriage ride, paired with a bottle of Bacchus<switch $gn70><case>.<case>─like that time I met you, come to think of it.<case>.</switch>
#. column 22: 0
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590962:0:21"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 俺たち兄弟は、良い物語に関わったようだ。<br>これだから旅の行商はやめられん。<br>さてさて、次はどこに向かったものかな……。
#. de: Wir haben uns so viel zu erzählen! Endlich alle drei Brüder vereint!<br>Siehst du, das ist der Reiz des Lebens als fahrender Händler - die unglaublichen Reisegeschichten. Ist wie bei euch Abenteurern, was?
#. fr: <switch $gn70><case>Tu as parcouru un chemin remarquable depuis la première fois que mon frère Brennan t'a vu<if $gn4>e</if><case>Tu as parcouru un chemin remarquable depuis la première fois où on s'est vus<case>Tu as parcouru un chemin remarquable depuis la première fois que mon frère Brendt t'a vu<if $gn4>e</if></switch>. C'est pour ça que j'aime la vie de nomade, moi. On rencontre toujours des gens in<shy>té<shy>res<shy>sants sur la route<nbsp>!
#. column 21: 0
#. column 22: 0
#. macro: <switch $gn70><case>saw you runnin' around the Wakin' Sands<case>met you on that carriage to Gridania<case>saw you runnin' around the Wakin' Sands</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = global number 70 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $gn70><case><case>Guess this means we're square, eh?<case></switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = global number 70 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590963:0:20"
msgid "Heh, you've come a long way since I first <switch $gn70><case>saw you runnin' around the Wakin' Sands<case>met you on that carriage to Gridania<case>saw you runnin' around the Wakin' Sands</switch>. <switch $gn70><case><case>Guess this means we're square, eh?<case></switch>"
msgstr "Хех, с тех пор как я впервые <switch $gn70><case>увидел тебя в Песках<case>встретил тебя в повозке по пути в Гриданию<case>увидел тебя в Песках</switch>, ты далеко продвинулся. <switch $gn70><case><case>Выходит, мы теперь в расчёте, а?<case></switch>"

#. ja: 兄貴がここに居ると聞いて、訪ねてきたんだが、<br>もう旅立ったあとのようだな。
#. de: <if ($gn70 == 1)>He, du bist doch <if $gn4>die junge Abenteurerin<else>der junge Abenteurer</if>, dich ich auf der Überfahrt nach Limsa getroffen habe! Was für ein Zufall, dass wir uns ausgerechnet hier treffen. Sieht aus, als hättest du dich schon gut eingelebt.<br>Was ich hier mache? Ich bin gekommen, weil mein Bruder hier sein soll. Aber wie es scheint, ist er schon weg.<else><if ($gn70 == 2)>Ich bin gekommen, weil mein Bruder hier sein soll. Aber wie es scheint, ist er schon weg.<else><if ($gn70 == 3)>Ich bin gekommen, weil mein Bruder hier sein soll. Aber wie es scheint, ist er schon weg.<else>Ich bin gekommen, weil mein Bruder hier sein soll. Aber wie es scheint, ist er schon weg.</if></if></if>
#. fr: <if ($gn70 == 1)>Hé<nbsp>! C'est pas toi qui étais sur le bateau vers Limsa Lominsa avec moi ? Comment vas-tu<nbsp>?<else><if ($gn70 == 2)>Salutations<nbsp>!<else><if ($gn70 == 3)> Salutations<nbsp>!<else> Salutations<nbsp>!</if></if></if> J'ai entendu dire que mon frère était passé par là il n'y a pas longtemps, mais je crois bien que je l'ai raté. J'ai revu aucun de mes deux frères depuis le Fléau, j'étais même pas sûr qu'ils étaient encore en vie, en fait.
#. column 21: I ain't seen either one of 'em since the Calamity─didn't even know if they were still alive. But after runnin' into folk who swore they knew me time an' again, I reckoned they had to be out there somewhere.
#. column 22: I've been travelin' an' peddlin' in the hopes I'd find me brothers ever since. If ye see a fella what looks like me, let him know that Brennan's lookin' for him, would you?
#. macro: <if ($gn70 == 1)>Hey, ain't you the <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if> that rode that boat into Limsa Lominsa with me? It is you, ain't it! Hah! Glad to see you've fou… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 70 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn70 == 2)>I heard tell one of me brothers came through not long ago. Looks like I just missed him, though.<else><if ($gn70 == 3)>I heard tell one of me b… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 70 == 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn70 == 3)>I heard tell one of me brothers came through not long ago. Looks like I just missed him, though.<else> I heard tell one of me brothers came thr… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 70 == 3 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590964:0:20"
msgid "<if ($gn70 == 1)>Hey, ain't you the <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if> that rode that boat into Limsa Lominsa with me? It is you, ain't it! Hah! Glad to see you've found a good home. What am I doin' here? Well, I heard tell one of me brothers came through not long ago. Looks like I just missed him, though.<else><if ($gn70 == 2)>I heard tell one of me brothers came through not long ago. Looks like I just missed him, though.<else><if ($gn70 == 3)>I heard tell one of me brothers came through not long ago. Looks like I just missed him, though.<else> I heard tell one of me brothers came through not long ago. Looks like I just missed him, though.</if></if></if>"
msgstr "<if ($gn70 == 1)>Эй, ты ведь <if $gn4>девушка<else>парень</if>, с которой я плыл на корабле до Лимсы Ломинсы? Точно ты! Ха! Рад, что ты нашёл себе хорошее место. Что я тут делаю? Слыхал, один из братьев недавно проходил. Похоже, я его разминул.<else><if ($gn70 == 2)>Слыхал, один из братьев недавно проходил. Похоже, я его разминул.<else><if ($gn70 == 3)>Слыхал, один из братьев недавно проходил. Похоже, я его разминул.<else>Слыхал, один из братьев недавно проходил. Похоже, я его разминул.</if></if></if>"

#. ja: 第七霊災で兄弟と生き別れて、<br>旅の行商をしながら、2人を探しているのさ。<br>まったく、どこをほっつき歩いているのやら。
#. de: Wir drei Brüder sind von der Katastrophe getrennt worden, und ich reise seitdem als Händler durch das Land, um sie zu suchen. Aber ich habe keine Ahnung, wo die beiden stecken könnten. Wenn du einen von ihnen siehst, richte ihm aus, dass Brennan nach ihnen sucht, ja?
#. fr: Mais il y a tant de gens qui jurent m'avoir déjà rencontré que j'imagine qu'ils doivent être quelque part, alors je voyage en les cherchant. Si tu rencontres un type qui me ressemble trait pour trait, dis-lui donc que Brennan le cherche, tu veux bien ?
#. column 20: <if ($gn70 == 1)>Hey, ain't you the <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if> that rode that boat into Limsa Lominsa with me? It is you, ain't it! Hah! Glad to see you've found a good home. What am I doin' here? Well, I heard tell one of me brothers came through not long ago. Looks like I just missed him, though.<else><if ($gn70 == 2)>I heard tell one of me brothers came through not long ago. Looks like I just missed him, though.<else><if ($gn70 == 3)>I heard tell one of me brothers came through not long ago. Looks like I just missed him, though.<else> I heard tell one of me brothers came through not long ago. Looks like I just missed him, though.</if></if></if>
#. column 22: I've been travelin' an' peddlin' in the hopes I'd find me brothers ever since. If ye see a fella what looks like me, let him know that Brennan's lookin' for him, would you?
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590964:0:21"
msgid "I ain't seen either one of 'em since the Calamity─didn't even know if they were still alive. But after runnin' into folk who swore they knew me time an' again, I reckoned they had to be out there somewhere."
msgstr "С тех пор как Бедствие разлучило нас, я ни разу не видел братьев. Даже не знал, живы ли они. Но мне то и дело встречались люди, которые клялись, что знают меня. Вот я и решил: значит, братья где-то рядом."

#. ja: 0
#. de: 0
#. fr: 0
#. column 20: <if ($gn70 == 1)>Hey, ain't you the <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if> that rode that boat into Limsa Lominsa with me? It is you, ain't it! Hah! Glad to see you've found a good home. What am I doin' here? Well, I heard tell one of me brothers came through not long ago. Looks like I just missed him, though.<else><if ($gn70 == 2)>I heard tell one of me brothers came through not long ago. Looks like I just missed him, though.<else><if ($gn70 == 3)>I heard tell one of me brothers came through not long ago. Looks like I just missed him, though.<else> I heard tell one of me brothers came through not long ago. Looks like I just missed him, though.</if></if></if>
#. column 21: I ain't seen either one of 'em since the Calamity─didn't even know if they were still alive. But after runnin' into folk who swore they knew me time an' again, I reckoned they had to be out there somewhere.
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590964:0:22"
msgid "I've been travelin' an' peddlin' in the hopes I'd find me brothers ever since. If ye see a fella what looks like me, let him know that Brennan's lookin' for him, would you?"
msgstr "С тех пор я странствую и торгую, надеясь найти братьев. Если встретишь парня, точь-в-точь похожего на меня, передай ему, что Бреннан его ищет, ладно?"

#. ja: どうやら兄貴は、あの商人に荷を運んできたようだな。<br>なら、しばらく待っていれば、また来るかもしれん。<br>待たせてもらうとするか。
#. de: Ich habe gehört, dass mein Bruder Waren an diesen Händler geliefert hat. Vielleicht kreuzt er hier wieder auf ... Ich werde ein bisschen warten.
#. fr: Les marchands m'ont dit que c'est Brendt qui a livré leur marchandise. Peut-être que si j'attends un peu, il reviendra avec une autre cargaison...
#. column 21: 0
#. column 22: 0
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590965:0:20"
msgid "The merchants told me it was Brendt that delivered their goods. Maybe if I wait a while, he'll come back with another shipment..."
msgstr "Торговцы сказали, что товары им доставил Брент. Может, подожду немного — вдруг он вернётся с новой партией..."

#. ja: おお、ブレモンド兄貴、それにブレモンダ！<br>英雄の相が集うは商機の証……<br>きっと2人に出会えると信じていたぜ！
#. de: Brendt und Bremondt - immer da zu finden, wo etwas los ist! Ich hätte es wissen sollen.
#. fr: Je pensais bien trouver mes deux frangins ici<nbsp>! Et toi aussi, évidemment, puisque le Refuge des sables est le point de ras<shy>sem<shy>ble<shy>ment des héros<nbsp>!
#. column 21: 0
#. column 22: 0
#. macro: <switch $gn70><case>Good thing you an' me escaped those bastards way back when, eh?<case><case></switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = global number 70 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590966:0:20"
msgid "Bah, Brendt thinks he had it bad. Try bribin' a pirate an' see where that gets you! <switch $gn70><case>Good thing you an' me escaped those bastards way back when, eh?<case><case></switch>"
msgstr "Брент думает, что ему тяжко пришлось. Пусть попробует подкупить пирата — сразу поймёт, почём фунт лиха! <switch $gn70><case>Хорошо, что мы с тобой давным-давно унесли ноги от этих мерзавцев, а?<case><case></switch>"

#. ja: 旅のはじまりに、たったひとつの指輪を渡す。<br>その指輪が巡り巡って、英雄の持ち物になるんだ。<br>なかなか面白い巡り合わせだろ？
#. de: <switch $gn70><case>Na also, da bist du ja wirklich <if $gn4>eine berühmte Abenteurerin<else>ein berühmter Abenteurer</if> geworden, wie ich es dir am Anfang aufgetragen habe! Aber dass du es <i>so</i> weit bringen würdest? Nicht zu glauben!<case>Hah! Diesen Garlearn hast du's aber gegeben! Ich hab doch gewusst, dass du was Besonderes bist, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>!<case>Hah! Diesen Garlearn hast du's aber gegeben! Ich hab doch gewusst, dass du was Besonderes bist, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>!</switch>
#. fr: <switch $gn70><case>Tu peux pas imaginer comme je suis fier de t'avoir rencontré<if $gn4>e</if> à tes débuts. Dès l'instant où je t'ai vu<if $gn4>e</if>, j'ai tout de suite su que tu étais voué<if $gn4>e</if> à un avenir brillant.<case>Tu as débuté comme un<if $gn4>e</if> simple <if $gn4>aventurière<else>aventurier</if>, et maintenant tu es <if $gn4>l'héroïne<else>le héros</if> du peuple. Quel bel exemple de réussite<nbsp>!<case>Tu as débuté comme un<if $gn4>e</if> simple <if $gn4>aventurière<else>aventurier</if>, et maintenant tu es <if $gn4>l'héroïne<else>le héros</if> du peuple. Quel bel exemple de réussite<nbsp>!</switch>
#. column 21: 0
#. column 22: 0
#. macro: <switch $gn70><case>I know I told you to become a storied personage I could brag about havin' met, but I never thought you'd go so far to oblige me!<case>Hah! Y… — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = global number 70 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:590967:0:20"
msgid "<switch $gn70><case>I know I told you to become a storied personage I could brag about havin' met, but I never thought you'd go so far to oblige me!<case>Hah! You sure gave those imperials what for! I knew you were somethin' special, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>!<case>Hah! You sure gave those imperials what for! I knew you were somethin' special, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>!</switch>"
msgstr "<switch $gn70><case>Я ведь говорил: стань кем-нибудь знаменитым, чтобы я мог похвастаться знакомством с тобой. Но не думал, что ты зайдёшь так далеко!<case>Ха! Ну ты имперцам и задала жару! Я знал, что ты у нас особенная, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>!<case>Ха! Ну ты имперцам и задала жару! Я знал, что ты у нас особенная, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>!</switch>"

#. ja: 知人が商いを始めるって聞いたから、<br>頼まれた荷を運んできたんだが……。<br>……さぁて、どこかな？
#. de: <if ($gn70 == 1)>Lass dich von mir nicht stören, <if $gn4>meine Liebe<else>mein Freund</if>.<else><if ($gn70 == 2)>Lass dich von mir nicht stören, <if $gn4>meine Liebe<else>mein Freund</if>.<else><if ($gn70 == 3)>Na, wenn das nicht <if $gn4>die junge Abenteurerin<else>der junge Abenteurer</if> aus der Kutsche ist! Was für ein Zufall, dass wir uns ausgerechnet hier treffen. Ich?<else>Lass dich von mir nicht stören, <if $gn4>meine Liebe<else>mein Freund</if>.</if></if></if> Ein Bekannter von mir will seine Waren feilbieten, also habe ich sie wie gewünscht hierher gebracht. Aber wo steckt er nur?
#. fr: <if ($gn70 == 1)>Salutations<nbsp>!<else><if ($gn70 == 2)>Salutations<nbsp>!<else><if ($gn70 == 3)>Ça alors<nbsp>! C'est toi qui étais avec moi sur la caravane l'autre fois<nbsp>! Je te reconnais<nbsp>!<else>Salutations<nbsp>!</if></if></if> Moi<nbsp>? Oh, je viens juste livrer une cargaison. Bon, où est-ce que je vais leur demander de poser tout ça...
#. column 21: 0
#. column 22: 0
